      "index": "cHry",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1381233767,
      "version": 671,
      "versionNonce": 464647304,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785228333543,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- it's a Layer 4 Protocol\n- Uses port numbers to identify applications on a host machine\n- It's a connection oriented protocol. Uses a 3-way handshake (SYN -> SyUN-ACK -> ACK) to establish a connection\n- It's a stateful protocol\n- Uses a 4-way termination process (FIN/ACK) to gracefully close connection\n- Data is divided into segments before transmission\n- Provides reliable, ordered of data between applications\n- Reciever sends achnowledgement (ACKs) to confirm received data \n- Lost segments are detected retransmitted\n- Duw to being reiable has higher overhead than UDP",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- it's a Layer 4 Protocol\n- Uses port numbers to identify applications on a host machine\n- It's a connection oriented protocol. Uses a 3-way handshake (SYN -> SyUN-ACK -> ACK) to establish a connection\n- It's a stateful protocol\n- Uses a 4-way termination process (FIN/ACK) to gracefully close connection\n- Data is divided into segments before transmission\n- Provides reliable, ordered of data between applications\n- Reciever sends achnowledgement (ACKs) to confirm received data \n- Lost segments are detected retransmitted\n- Duw to being reiable has higher overhead than UDP",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
